---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "I'm a starter theme for Astro.build",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>Thanks for stopping by 🎉</p>
		<p>
			I’m the founder of Top League Technologies Pvt Ltd, where we specialize in content writing,
			SEO, WordPress Development, and social media services.
		</p>
		<p>
			I’ve been active in the digital marketing space since 2006. Over the years, I’ve watched the
			industry evolve from keyword-focussed SEO to today’s GEO (Generative Engine Optimization).
		</p>
		<p>
			My experience spans hundreds of clients across the globe, and I love helping businesses unlock
			their potential through smart and effective digital strategies.
		</p>
		<p>
			I can build you a sleek WordPress site, create useful content, and devise an SEO plan that
			gets results. My approach combines the latest trends in web design with time-tested marketing
			strategies to help you stand out online.
		</p>
		<p>
			If you’re ready to take your business to the next level, let’s chat. You can connect with me
			on Twitter or simply drop me a line via the contact page.
		</p>

		<p>Here are some blog posts you may want to read to evaluate my skills:</p>
		<ul class="list-inside list-disc" role="list">
			<li>Content Writing</li>
			<li>WordPress Development</li>
			<li>Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Clone or fork my <a
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://github.com/chrismwilliams/astro-cactus"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">repo</a
			> if you like me!
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
